# Outbound Voice Spec (life surfaces)

## Invariant

`outbound_artifact(operator_will_send) ⇒ Use the outbound-voice-spec skill` ∧ `Use the prose-discipline skill` — bind **OUTBOUND SPEC** before the first sentence; `¬ instruct(model_identity)`.

**Scope gate (OR):** fires when **either** a claude.ai life session **or** a Cursor **life-representation** seat holds the work (correspondence liaison, `vortex-life` MCP, agent_bus on personal/outbound deliverables). Code-lane engineering without life rep → per-task OUTBOUND SPEC only when an outbound artifact is in scope.

Full binding (L1–L6, OUTBOUND SPEC fields, liaison pack, verifier): Use the `outbound-voice-spec` skill. Register and tells: Use the `prose-discipline` skill.

## Life-session placement

| Layer | Surface | Loads |
|---|---|---|
| Session orientation | `cortex_brief` once | Lean seat card, deadlines, skills index |
| Matter facts | `recall(op="matter", q=<matter>)` when outbound ties to hub correspondence | Scoped factual recall only |
| Per draft | OUTBOUND SPEC Signer + Standing limits + Material attested | Attested for *this* message only |
| Persistence | claude.ai Project instructions or Customize skills | Across phone sessions — template: `docs/agent-guides/templates/life-project-instructions.md` |

**Avoid:** bare person-entity recall seeds alone as standing boot — cross-domain graph noise invites invention from records not attested for this message.

## Liaison (Cursor, operator not at IDE)

Harvest thread → operator attests material + limits → insert OUTBOUND SPEC + skill invokes → deliverable = **one outbound body** (liaison does not rewrite in liaison voice on the bus).
